sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Browser
    participant API as Backend API
    participant S3Raw as S3 Raw
    participant SQS as Amazon SQS
    participant Lambda as Lambda
    participant Batch as AWS Batch
    participant S3Proc as S3 Processed
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>API: POST /initiate-upload
    API->>DB: New record, UPLOADING
    API-->>User: Pre-signed URL, 15 min
    User->>S3Raw: PUT video, or 32 MiB parts

    User->>API: PATCH /confirm-upload
    API->>DB: Set PROCESSING

    S3Raw-->>SQS: s3:ObjectCreated
    SQS-->>Lambda: Event source mapping
    Lambda->>Batch: SubmitJob
    Lambda-->>SQS: Message deleted
    Note over Lambda,SQS: Deleted at SUBMIT,<br/>not at completion

    activate Batch
    Batch->>S3Raw: Download source
    Batch->>Batch: Screen frames
    Batch->>Batch: FFmpeg, ≤6 renditions
    Batch->>Batch: Playlist, thumbnail
    Batch->>S3Proc: Upload segments
    Batch->>DB: Conditional write, READY
    deactivate Batch

    Note over Batch,DB: The conditional write is<br/>what guards duplicate jobs
    Note over SQS,Batch: Container ends, Fargate scales to zero.<br/>5 minutes or more: planner, chunk array, finalizer
